[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2932375748","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106688#issuecomment-2932375748","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106688","id":2932375748,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uyIDE","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-02T20:29:44Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T20:29:53Z","body":"IMO blocking every shortcut is too much. Right now you can e.g. select nodes in 2D editor and delete them, and it will be synced with the running project. Selecting a node will deselect any selected remote node, and show the selected node in the inspector, so I think this behavior is fine.\r\nAlso some shortcuts are still actove, like Add Node (Ctrl+A).\r\n\r\nThe main problem here is that renaming a node with visible remote tree is broken. The popup appears at wrong position and the rename takes no effect.\r\nEither the rename should be blocked (only), or the local tree should automatically appear on rename.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/god